OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny lingering rain in Caithness
OL,6,Fsoon clearing. Then a day of sunny
OL,7,Fintervals and blustery showers, these
OL,8,Fheavier and more frequent in the west.
OL,9,FWindy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few clear intervals at
OL,12,Ffirst in east otherwise mostly cloudy
OL,13,Fwith frequent showers, heavy at times
OL,14,Fwith the chance of thunder. Strong
OL,15,Fwesterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FSaturday will be another day
OL,18,Fof frequent showers, heavy at times,
OL,19,Fand some sunny intervals. A windy day
OL,20,Fwith west to northwesterly gales at
OL,21,Ffirst over Isles and western coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
